{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:08Z","created_by_operation":"op_bf679629b4c44e6593d0a01dbe5bb2fa","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b7d0ba4811f8358ebb573999b823f55d887046a8bf107e752c12962c5c0fb96a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"getpaseo/paseo@d1b705a0cd91 snapshot 412941229c6b93c1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0b27fc95f795a201f61168852e41306edfddd8024f852e9930671103c9421a20","slc_28c4608dbbccb789d1a86da13d348423ae4cce5ec0363bbb646db0a6096be5ca","slc_36ae9cc92336bd2d1e1e3564803a440caf5a11adb9cc2f4d72cd01c621806e68","slc_830c5b582f4d15c212a54e2ab64b99cc2c3f07cf4bf7fb6668b389a7140979d7"],"source_ids":["src_d1f4bd3f9cfe5d84a3d44e8511326d34"],"text":"A TypeScript SDK package `@getpaseo/client` connects over WebSocket (e.g. ws://127.0.0.1:6767/ws) and lets code create agents with a provider, cwd, and prompt, then await their result.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:08Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bf679629b4c44e6593d0a01dbe5bb2fa"}
